    "label": "THE CITY OF SHARED QUESTS / INHABITATION"
  },
  {
    "page": 14,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 706,
    "width": 345,
    "height": 64.8,
    "label": "You are inside\nthe adventure"
  },
  {
    "page": 14,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 400,
    "top": 700,
    "width": 560,
    "height": 71.6,
    "label": "You cross the bridge with someone who knows a different version of the tale. Above the roofs, the shared world answers a choice your group has made. The bridge remains solid beneath your hand. Spatially anchored AR gives many people one unfolding encounter; the physical city supplies distance, weather, companions, and somewhere to sit when the adventure pauses."
  },
  {
    "page": 15,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "WORLDS WE CAN INHABIT / EDITION 04"
  },
  {
    "page": 15,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 920,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 40,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "15 / 25"
  },
