    "top": 681,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 14,
    "label": "THE CITY OF SHARED QUESTS / MAKING A WORLD"
  },
  {
    "page": 15,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 706,
    "width": 345,
    "height": 64.8,
    "label": "The workshop\nbehind the magic"
  },
  {
    "page": 15,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 400,
    "top": 700,
    "width": 560,
    "height": 71.6,
    "label": "You come looking for a costume piece and stay to invent a creature. Above the service level are homes, guild workshops, and the street where the story unfolds. Below, props return, robots help repair them, and lighting and digital systems are maintained. The realm has an ongoing material life; its inhabitants can become its next authors."
  },
  {
    "page": 16,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "WORLDS WE CAN INHABIT / EDITION 04"
  },
  {
    "page": 16,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 920,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 40,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "16 / 25"
  },
  {
    "page": 16,
    "kind": "image",
