  },
  {
    "page": 16,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 681,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 14,
    "label": "THE HOUSE OF WORLDS / A PURPOSE-BUILT AR MEGASTRUCTURE"
  },
  {
    "page": 16,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 706,
    "width": 345,
    "height": 64.8,
    "label": "A building\nmade for worlds"
  },
  {
    "page": 16,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 400,
    "top": 700,
    "width": 560,
    "height": 71.6,
    "label": "You approach a megastructure conceived for shared AR worlds from its first beam. Enormous stacked halls provide real distances to walk; dark lift cores connect them. Between halls, thick technical floors carry the machinery of changing environments. You are entering an architecture whose purpose is to let whole worlds become places people can inhabit together."
  },
  {
    "page": 17,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "WORLDS WE CAN INHABIT / EDITION 04"
  },
  {
    "page": 17,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 920,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 40,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "17 / 25"
  },
  {
    "page": 17,
    "kind": "image",
    "x": 0,
    "top": 0,
    "width": 1000,
    "height": 666.6666666666666,
    "label": "assets-v2/elevator-as-portal.png"
  },
  {
    "page": 17,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 681,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 14,
    "label": "THE HOUSE OF WORLDS / PASSAGE"
  },
  {
    "page": 17,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 706,
    "width": 345,
    "height": 64.8,
    "label": "The door opens\nsomewhere else"
  },
  {
    "page": 17,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 400,
    "top": 700,
    "width": 560,
    "height": 71.6,
    "label": "You enter the cabin with a friend. The doors close; the atmosphere changes. When they open, the next world seems to have been waiting on the other side. The lift has carried your body to another floor. Coordinated sound, shared AR, and an arrival designed around the doorway turn that ordinary movement into the felt experience of crossing realities."
  },
  {
    "page": 18,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "WORLDS WE CAN INHABIT / EDITION 04"
  },
  {
    "page": 18,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 920,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 40,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "18 / 25"
  },
  {
    "page": 18,
    "kind": "image",
    "x": 0,
    "top": 0,
    "width": 1000,
    "height": 666.6666666666666,
    "label": "assets-v4/ar/ar-worldhall.png"
  },
  {
    "page": 18,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 681,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 14,
    "label": "THE HOUSE OF WORLDS / INHABITATION"
  },
  {
    "page": 18,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 706,
    "width": 345,
    "height": 64.8,
    "label": "Stay in the\ncloud harbor"
  },
  {
    "page": 18,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 400,
    "top": 700,
    "width": 560,
    "height": 71.6,
    "label": "You step into the cloud harbor and feel the scale of it before you speak. Friends wait beside a railing; their voices belong to the same space as yours. A vast physical hall gives the realm room to breathe. Walkways, touchable surfaces, spatial sound, and shared AR let an imagined place become somewhere people can gather and develop traditions."
  },
  {
    "page": 19,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "WORLDS WE CAN INHABIT / EDITION 04"
  },
  {
    "page": 19,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 920,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 40,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "19 / 25"
  },
  {
    "page": 19,
    "kind": "image",
    "x": 0,
    "top": 0,
    "width": 1000,
    "height": 666.6666666666666,
    "label": "assets-v4/ar/ar-reality-pair.png"
  },
  {
    "page": 19,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 681,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 14,
    "label": "THE HOUSE OF WORLDS / PHYSICAL AND EXPERIENCED SPACE"
  },
  {
    "page": 19,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 706,
    "width": 345,
    "height": 64.8,
    "label": "One body.\nTwo ways of seeing."
  },
  {
    "page": 19,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 400,
    "top": 700,
    "width": 560,
    "height": 71.6,
    "label": "Look at the bare hall, then the cloud harbor: the walkway bends in the same place, your companions stand on the same floor, and your hand meets the same rail. Structure and tactile surfaces stay aligned. The proposed display system supplies visual replacement and shared spatial cues; the building supplies the body of the world."
  },
  {
    "page": 20,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "WORLDS WE CAN INHABIT / EDITION 04"
  },
  {
    "page": 20,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 920,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 40,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "20 / 25"
  },
  {
    "page": 20,
    "kind": "image",
    "x": 0,
    "top": 0,
    "width": 1000,
    "height": 666.6666666666666,
    "label": "assets-v4/ar/ar-section.png"
  },
  {
    "page": 20,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 681,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 14,
    "label": "THE HOUSE OF WORLDS / WORKING SECTION"
  },
  {
    "page": 20,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 706,
    "width": 345,
    "height": 64.8,
    "label": "The architecture\nof many realities"
  },
  {
    "page": 20,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 400,
    "top": 700,
    "width": 560,
    "height": 89.5,
    "label": "World halls rest above layers that make their transformations possible: climate and sound systems, tracking, freight, prop storage, and repair. Passenger lifts bring you into a realm; service routes bring its next physical setting. Stable terrain decks and tactile anchors support changing perceptions. This is an architectural proposal for an inhabited medium, built expressly around shared AR."
  },
  {
    "page": 21,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "WORLDS WE CAN INHABIT / EDITION 04"
  },
  {
    "page": 21,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 920,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 40,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "21 / 25"
  },
  {
    "page": 21,
    "kind": "image",
    "x": 0,
    "top": 0,
    "width": 1000,
