    "label": "assets/material-lives.png"
  },
  {
    "page": 21,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 681,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 14,
    "label": "THE MATERIAL INHERITANCE / WHAT A WORLD LEAVES AVAILABLE"
  },
  {
    "page": 21,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 706,
    "width": 345,
    "height": 64.8,
    "label": "A building’s\nnext beginning"
  },
  {
    "page": 21,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 400,
    "top": 700,
    "width": 560,
    "height": 89.5,
    "label": "A beam waits for another building. Panels, fittings, and tools return with information about their condition and use. Public designs and compatible connections make them available to new makers. Recovery still needs energy, inspection, storage, and care. Freedom to transform grows from keeping materials useful, while living ecosystems need their own conditions for renewal."
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "WORLDS WE CAN INHABIT / EDITION 04"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 920,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 40,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "22 / 25"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 37,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 14,
    "label": "THE GENERATIVE UNDERSTANDING / WHAT THESE WORLDS ARE FOR"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 77,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 101.47999999999999,
    "label": "Keep the conditions\nof becoming alive"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 58,
    "top": 209,
    "width": 884,
    "height": 30,
    "label": "“It’s not about being generative yourself, it’s about ensuring your environment is”"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 58,
    "top": 246,
    "width": 884,
    "height": 13,
    "label": "Ren / 30 April 2026"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 310,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 24,
    "label": "The world we build shapes what people learn, desire, and create. Their lives reshape that world in turn."
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 53,
    "top": 385,
    "width": 186,
    "height": 19,
    "label": "Shared understandings"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 289,
    "top": 385,
    "width": 186,
    "height": 19,
    "label": "Choices and institutions"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 525,
    "top": 385,
    "width": 186,
    "height": 19,
    "label": "Lived environments"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 761,
    "top": 385,
    "width": 186,
    "height": 19,
    "label": "Further lives and beginnings"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 494,
    "width": 284,
    "height": 21,
    "label": "Care beyond yourself"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 524,
    "width": 284,
    "height": 38,
    "label": "Sustain the people, knowledge, materials, and living systems your life depends on."
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 355,
    "top": 494,
    "width": 284,
    "height": 21,
    "label": "Enable further beginnings"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 355,
    "top": 524,
    "width": 284,
    "height": 38,
    "label": "Leave tools and conditions others can continue from. Rest and continuity belong here too."
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 670,
    "top": 494,
    "width": 284,
    "height": 21,
    "label": "Let many lives flourish"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 670,
    "top": 524,
    "width": 284,
    "height": 38,
    "label": "Study, play, expression, exploration, care, and quiet lives need no common ranking."
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 613,
    "width": 284,
    "height": 21,
    "label": "Keep rivalry within bounds"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 643,
    "width": 284,
    "height": 38,
    "label": "A game’s prizes should not give winners control over another person’s necessities."
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 355,
    "top": 613,
    "width": 284,
    "height": 21,
    "label": "Build for future transformation"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 355,
    "top": 643,
    "width": 284,
    "height": 38,
    "label": "Keep knowledge available and material useful. Preserve the ability to change a world again."
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 670,
    "top": 613,
    "width": 284,
    "height": 21,
    "label": "Learn from consequences"
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 670,
    "top": 643,
    "width": 284,
    "height": 38,
    "label": "Let neighbors, experience, and unexpected lives change the project and its principles."
  },
  {
    "page": 22,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 746,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 17,
    "label": "生生不息 is developed here as generation enabling further generation. It does not mean maximizing output, complexity, or the number of possibilities."
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "WORLDS WE CAN INHABIT / EDITION 04"
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 920,
    "top": 802,
    "width": 40,
    "height": 10,
    "label": "23 / 25"
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 37,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 14,
    "label": "AN INVITATION / TURNING A WORLD INTO A PLACE"
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 77,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 125.08,
    "label": "Where would\nyou begin?"
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 226,
    "width": 795,
    "height": 58,
    "label": "Choose a place that draws you in. Then follow a body through it and a dependency beneath it."
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 338,
    "width": 40,
    "height": 25,
    "label": "01"
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 96,
    "top": 338,
    "width": 370,
    "height": 29,
    "label": "Arrive"
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 96,
    "top": 379,
    "width": 350,
    "height": 44,
    "label": "Draw the first thing you see, hear, touch, and want to move toward."
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 510,
    "top": 338,
    "width": 40,
    "height": 25,
    "label": "02"
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 566,
    "top": 338,
    "width": 370,
    "height": 29,
    "label": "Inhabit"
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 566,
    "top": 379,
    "width": 350,
    "height": 44,
    "label": "Let someone meet a friend, pursue a purpose, or enjoy doing very little."
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 481,
    "width": 40,
    "height": 25,
    "label": "03"
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 96,
    "top": 481,
    "width": 370,
    "height": 29,
    "label": "Look beneath"
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 96,
    "top": 522,
    "width": 350,
    "height": 44,
    "label": "Trace the structure, energy, materials, knowledge, and maintenance that support the experience."
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 510,
    "top": 481,
    "width": 40,
    "height": 25,
    "label": "04"
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 566,
    "top": 481,
    "width": 370,
    "height": 29,
    "label": "Build and learn"
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 566,
    "top": 522,
    "width": 350,
    "height": 44,
    "label": "Make a useful part. Let what happens change both the place and the principles."
  },
  {
    "page": 23,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 686,
    "width": 910,
    "height": 87,
    "label": "A spacecraft hall, a city of quests, a garden, a university, or a megastructure of shared realities can each be the beginning of a different way to live. Our task is to build the conditions in which those lives can flourish, and further worlds can emerge."
  },
  {
