  },
  {
    "page": 25,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 77,
    "width": 920,
    "height": 101.47999999999999,
    "label": "Seeing a possibility\nis the beginning"
  },
  {
    "page": 25,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 233,
    "width": 432,
    "height": 23,
    "label": "The vision and this edition"
  },
  {
    "page": 25,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 271,
    "width": 432,
    "height": 117.0,
    "label": "Ren’s dialogue joins autonomous productive capacity, shared abundance, freedom from compulsory labor, generative culture, and plural ways of living. This visual edition answers his request for embodied experiences and a megabuilding designed expressly for AR. Scenes, architectural forms, sensory details, and layouts are AI-developed proposals."
  },
  {
    "page": 25,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 515,
    "top": 233,
    "width": 432,
    "height": 23,
    "label": "What the images show"
  },
  {
    "page": 25,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 515,
    "top": 271,
    "width": 432,
    "height": 117.0,
    "label": "Twenty distinct concept illustrations, each placed once. Twelve are new: embodied experiences, architectural sections, and the purpose-built AR megastructure. They share a design vocabulary within each case; they are not views derived from one geometrically resolved 3D model. Cutaways make spatial ideas visible without establishing structural or engineering feasibility."
  },
  {
    "page": 25,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 427,
    "width": 432,
    "height": 23,
    "label": "How to read the AR worlds"
  },
  {
    "page": 25,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 40,
    "top": 465,
    "width": 432,
    "height": 117.0,
    "label": "Bodies move through real floors, paths, lifts, and tactile settings. Perceptual environments are aligned to that space. Large visual replacement requires a proposed occlusive display or passthrough system; ordinary transparent glasses alone are not assumed to erase the building. Immense apparent skies and distances are experienced, not literal additional floor area."
  },
  {
    "page": 25,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 515,
    "top": 427,
    "width": 432,
    "height": 23,
    "label": "The argument remains available"
  },
  {
    "page": 25,
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 515,
    "top": 465,
    "width": 432,
    "height": 97.5,
    "label": "The atlas retains the technical, generative, and material foundations in compact form. Edition 03 and the project’s linked foundations retain the fuller argument, evidence notes, and original source passages. Ren’s April 30 quotation and 生生不息 anchor the generative orientation."
  },
